  "cross_domain_rules": [
    "A domain owns its specialized semantics; shared recurring functions are supplied by SWIRMs.",
    "A TEAM is formed when one intent/mission requires capabilities spanning multiple SWIRMs or domains.",
    "TEAM membership is a relationship; it does not mint identity or authority.",
    "A SWIRM is comparative and may contain multiple providers, agents, tools or human roles.",
    "ABBA may compose and recompose Teams, but authority remains external to intelligence.",
    "Products consume these compositions; products do not become the owners of the universal capability meanings."
  ]
